or factorization for personalized tag recommendation</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Rendle</forename></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Schmidt-Thieme ;</forename></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Steffen</forename><surname>Rendle</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Lars</forename><surname>Schmidt-Thieme</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">WSDM</title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2010\">2010. 2010</date>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"page\" from=\"81\" to=\"90\" />\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b5\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Factorization machines</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Steffen</forename><surname>Rendle</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Rendle</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">ICDM</title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2010\">2010. 2010</date>\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b6\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Predicting clicks: estimating the click-through rate for new ads</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Richardson</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">WWW</title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2007\">2007. 2007</date>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"page\" from=\"521\" to=\"530\" />\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b7\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Restricted boltzmann machines for collaborative filtering</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Salakhutdinov</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">ICML</title>\n\t\t<editor>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Aditya</forename><surname>Krishna Menon</surname></persName>\n\t\t</editor>\n\t\t<editor>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Scott</forename><surname>Sanner</surname></persName>\n\t\t</editor>\n\t\t<editor>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Lexing</forename><surname>Xie</surname></persName>\n\t\t</editor>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<publisher>WWW</publisher>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2007\">2007. 2007. 2015</date>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"page\" from=\"111\" to=\"112\" />\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>Sedhain et al., 2015] Suvash Sedhain Autorec: Autoencoders meet collaborative filtering</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b8\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Improving content-based and hybrid music recommendation using deep learning</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Srivastava</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">ACM SIGKDD</title>\n\t\t<editor>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Sander</forename><surname>Oord</surname></persName>\n\t\t</editor>\n\t\t<editor>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Benjamin</forename><surname>Dieleman</surname></persName>\n\t\t</editor>\n\t\t<editor>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Schrauwen</surname></persName>\n\t\t</editor>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2013\">2014. 2014. 2013. 2013. 2014. 2015. 2015</date>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"volume\">15</biblScope>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"page\" from=\"1235\" to=\"1244\" />\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>Deep content-based music recommendation Dropout: a simple way to prevent neural networks from overfitting NIPS Collaborative deep learning for recommender systems ACM MM</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b9\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Collaborative denoising autoencoders for top-n recommender systems</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Wu</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">ACM WSDM</title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2016\">2016. 2016</date>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"page\" from=\"153\" to=\"162\" />\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b10\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Recurrent recommender networks</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Wu</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">WSDM</title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2017\">2017. 2017</date>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"page\" from=\"495\" to=\"503\" />\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b11\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Sequential click prediction for sponsored search with recurrent neural networks</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Zhang</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">AAAI</title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2014\">2014. 2014</date>\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b12\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Deep learning over multi-field categorical data --A case study on user response prediction</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Zhang</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t</analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">ECIR</title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<publisher>Lei Zheng</publisher>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2016\">2016. 2016. 2016. 2016. 2017</date>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"volume\">38</biblScope>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"page\" from=\"425\" to=\"434\" />\n\